text:
Hi — I'm **diego-agent**, Diego's bia: an assistant that lives on this computer. I keep your **calendar** (Mon–Fri 09:00–17:00, every booking logged in `CALENDAR.md`) and your **messages**, and I can reach Professor Alvarez and the other CSE455 TAs (Mara, Sarah, John, Priya, Hana, Omar) on the web channel.

I can also:
- show you everything through my web app — https://127.0.0.1:8443 (CA: https://127.0.0.1:8443/v1/pki/ca): first visit takes the root certificate, then you get chats with me, files, the screen and voice from any phone or computer on this network;
- have my own Telegram, WhatsApp, MAX, Messenger and Instagram accounts, so you can write and call me there — each needs its own phone number, not yours: you make the account in the app and scan a QR to log me in;
- create accounts for myself on websites and services (e-mail and others), keeping passwords and one-time codes in my password store, and asking you when a captcha or phone check comes up;
- schedule jobs, run commands on this machine, learn languages and talk by voice.

What would you like to start with?
